# The installer's page of what to install: an item a line, its fields apart by a TAB.
#   ID	PARENT	DEFAULT	LABEL	UNITS
# PARENT is '-' at the top.  DEFAULT is required (cannot be cleared), on or off.  UNITS
# are the units the item installs (their requirements come with them), '-' for none.
# tools/build/installer-units.py copies these to the index and adds, under other, an
# item for each package unit that no item here names.
