base	-	required	Base System	base
desktop	-	on	Keiland Desktop	desktop
firmware	-	on	Firmware	firmware
packages	-	on	Packages	-
clang	packages	off	Clang	lang-clang devel-pkgconf
openssh	packages	on	OpenSSH	network-openssh
openssl	packages	on	OpenSSL and CA certificates	security-openssl security-ca-certificates
gtk4	packages	off	GTK4	desktop-gtk4
fonts	packages	on	Fonts	fonts-noto-color-emoji fonts-hand-hershey
libavcodec	packages	off	libavcodec	multimedia-libavcodec
curl	packages	off	curl	network-curl
python	packages	off	Python	lang-python3
other	packages	off	Other packages	-
